--- Ask the notes — Crow's third reference app (docs/rag-design.md). The
--- markdown notes under docs/ are cut into chunks, embedded once and
--- indexed; a question finds its chunks by two rankings — the vectors'
--- and BM25's, fused by reciprocal rank — and the model answers from them,
--- citing each one it used. The model and the embedder are reached by
--- the environment's RAG_MODEL and RAG_EMBEDDER (Ollama's by default);
--- the tests replay what a recording kept (crow test --fixtures).
use web, ui
use chat.page

serve[3400]
page['/', page.render]
